WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.549
In tutorial 1.2, you'll set up your
company, the home for your websites,

00:00:10.599 --> 00:00:11.923
reports and team.

00:00:12.953 --> 00:00:17.128
First, look at the steps on the
left. Setup takes about five minutes,

00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:19.726
and your progress is
saved after every step.

00:00:20.736 --> 00:00:23.311
Now type your company
name and your industry,

00:00:23.361 --> 00:00:25.475
then choose how many people work there.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:33.150
Next, type your main website address.
You'll add it properly in the next step.

00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:39.436
Need help at any point? Click
the Guides icon at the top.

00:00:39.486 --> 00:00:42.415
Every job we ask of you
is there, step by step.

00:00:43.419 --> 00:00:46.494
Then click Continue.
Your company is created,

00:00:46.544 --> 00:00:48.738
and the next step asks for your website.

00:00:50.419 --> 00:00:54.894
Your company now has its own workspace,
with a tick beside the first step.

00:00:54.944 --> 00:00:59.094
Stop whenever you like: when you come
back, you pick up where you left off.

00:01:00.109 --> 00:01:04.034
So, see the setup steps, name your
company, add your website address,

00:01:04.084 --> 00:01:05.336
and click Continue.

00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:11.959
Your company is set up. Next,
add your website in tutorial 1.3.
